        "created_at": "2017-02-12T22:14:21.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I'm not sure if this is the place for this for it, but theres a couple of questions that have been bouncing around my mind.</p><p>first off: what is the plan for the Sentinels Video Game? I've been going crazy here doing the unlocks (only 2 of which i found without help, I'm sad to admit) but there's a few characters without any Variants, and some with a bunch of others. totally would understand if some were to be not made (ultra exclusive or something of the like) but curiosity is gnawing at me to ask.</p><p>also, I am having SUCH a terrible time with the unlock for DW Setback. I've looked up the post on the Dark Watch's synergy,( https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/darkwatch-synergy-9361 for those who are curious) and just can't pull off the requirements of taking out the Chairman. I'm at a loss here.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>if this isn't the appropriate place or something like that, just let me know or something. Please help(mostly with that second part. lol<span>)!</span></p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:48:49.677Z",
