        "raw": "<p>I&#39;m not sure if this is the place for this for it, but theres a couple of questions that have been bouncing around my mind.</p><p>first off: what is the plan for the Sentinels Video Game? I&#39;ve been going crazy here doing the unlocks (only 2 of which i found without help, I&#39;m sad to admit) but there&#39;s a few characters without any Variants, and some with a bunch of others. totally would understand if some were to be not made (ultra exclusive or something of the like) but curiosity is gnawing at me to ask.</p><p>also, I am having SUCH a terrible time with the unlock for DW Setback. I&#39;ve looked up the post on the Dark Watch&#39;s synergy,( https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/darkwatch-synergy-9361 for those who are curious) and just can&#39;t pull off the requirements of taking out the Chairman. I&#39;m at a loss here.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>if this isn&#39;t the appropriate place or something like that, just let me know or something. Please help(mostly with that second part. lol<span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">)!</span></p>",
