        "username": "Powerhound_2000",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/powerhound_2000/{size}/1859_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-02-12T22:27:44.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The mods will move the thread if they see it's needed so no worries there. &nbsp; This seems related to the just the video game. &nbsp;</p><p>Handelabra, who makes the video game, plans to make all variants of the hero and villains available and if some hero doesn't have any it's more just a matter of time. &nbsp;As to help with unlocking DW Setback it still ends up being a bit of luck but the strategy I found success with on normal or advanced was looking for Setback to start with Friendly Fire and DW Mr Fixer after Setback with Dual Crowbars in hand. &nbsp;With those Mr Fixer can take out the Operative round one and that immensely helps. &nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
