        "created_at": "2017-02-17T19:12:59.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>HOLY CRAP! just pulled it off, and it was thanks to a wierd set of circumstances.</p><p>someone in the Unexpected Combinations pointed out how Mr. Fixer's Dual Crowbars + Setback's Friendly Fire makes for a fun infinite loop to hitting opponents. it took 4 turns, but the last turn was taking the Chairman himself from full HP to 0. Setback unfortunately went down too, but still got the unlock.</p><p>just thought i'd let yalls know.</p>",
